---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { mailto } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Contact us" description="Email HumAIn Logic at hello@humainlogic.com to ask a question, report outdated info, or suggest a tool or job.">
<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h1>Contact us</h1></div></section>
<div class="container section" style="padding-top:var(--space-6)"><div class="prose">
<p class="lede">Email us at <a href={mailto('Question about HumAIn Logic')}>hello@humainlogic.com</a>. We read every message.</p>
<h2 id="report">Report a problem or outdated info</h2>
<p>Tell us the page, what looks wrong, and a link to the correct source if you have one. Every tool and job page also has its own report link that fills in the page for you.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={mailto('Report a problem: ', 'Page:\nWhat looks wrong:\nCorrect source (if you have one):\n')}>Email a report</a></p>
<h2 id="suggest">Suggest a tool or a job to track</h2>
<p>Send the tool's name and website, or the job title, and why it would help people like you. No company can pay to be added.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href={mailto('Suggest a tool: ', "Tool name:\nWebsite:\nWhat it helps with:\n")}>Suggest a tool</a> <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={mailto('Suggest a job: ', 'Job title:\nWhy it should be tracked:\n')}>Suggest a job</a></p>
<h2>Already get The Sunday Brief?</h2>
<p>Just reply to any issue. It reaches the same inbox.</p>
</div></div>
</Base>
